@startuml 3.3.3 - View Client Profile
title Sequence Diagram — 3.3.3 - View Client Profile

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "User" as user
actor "Agency Member" as agency_member
boundary "ClientProfileListPage (UI)" as clientprofilelistpage_ui
boundary "WorkspaceClientsPage (UI)" as workspaceclientspage_ui
boundary "ClientProfileController" as clientprofilecontroller
boundary "WorkspaceController" as workspacecontroller
control "ClientProfileServiceImpl" as clientprofileserviceimpl
control "WorkspaceServiceImpl" as workspaceserviceimpl
entity "ClientProfileRepository" as clientprofilerepository
entity "WorkspaceMemberRepository" as workspacememberrepository
entity "client_profiles" as client_profiles
entity "workspace_members" as workspace_members

' === Flow 1 ===
note over user, workspace_members : == LUỒNG 1: USER XEM DANH SÁCH CLIENT PROFILE CỦA MÌNH ==\nUser xem tất cả thương hiệu do tài khoản của mình sở hữu (/client-profiles)

user -> clientprofilelistpage_ui: opens /client-profiles
clientprofilelistpage_ui -> clientprofilecontroller: GET /api/v1/client-profile/mine
clientprofilecontroller -> clientprofileserviceimpl: listMine(currentUser)
clientprofileserviceimpl -> clientprofilerepository: findByUserId(currentUser.getId())
clientprofilerepository -> client_profiles: query by user_id
client_profiles --> clientprofilerepository: List<row> (0..N — a user may own several profiles)
clientprofileserviceimpl -> clientprofilecontroller: map rows -> List<ClientProfileResponse>
clientprofilecontroller --> clientprofilelistpage_ui: 200 OK List<ClientProfileResponse>
clientprofilelistpage_ui -> user: renders one card per brand

' === Flow 2 ===
note over agency_member, workspace_members : == LUỒNG 2: AGENCY MEMBER XEM DANH SÁCH CLIENT TRONG WORKSPACE ==\nAgency Member xem danh sách khách hàng trong Workspace (/workspaces/:id/clients)

agency_member -> workspaceclientspage_ui: opens /workspaces/:id/clients
workspaceclientspage_ui -> workspacecontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{id}/members
workspacecontroller -> workspaceserviceimpl: listMembers(workspaceId)
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacememberrepository: check workspace exists + caller is active member
workspacememberrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: active workspace_members rows (joined to client_profiles for CLIENT rows)
workspaceserviceimpl --> workspacecontroller: List<WorkspaceMemberResponse> (all roles)
workspacecontroller --> workspaceclientspage_ui: 200 OK List<WorkspaceMemberResponse>
workspaceclientspage_ui -> agency_member: FE filters role === \"CLIENT\", displays with \"Add client\" action
note over user, workspace_members : Lưu ý: backend list endpoint trả về mọi vai trò (MANAGER/CREATOR/CLIENT) — việc tách Members (/members) và Clients (/clients) được lọc tại client-side.

@enduml